  "solution": {
    "text": "For <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be surjective,<br /><math><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>40</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, for&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathv